# Scenarios v3 mannequins: the drawn pose library IS committed (POSE_SEED points at
# those exact filenames, so a fresh checkout would otherwise have broken poses).
# Its inputs and derivatives are not:
#   src/     - licensed stock photographs the mannequins were redrawn from
#   preview/ - 1K derivatives, rebuilt on demand
public/poses/scen3/src/
public/poses/scen3/preview/

# The stock photographs the knees-up mannequins were traced from, as supplied. Same
